  "content": "Anekajātisaṃsāraṃ, sandhāvissaṃ anibbisaṃ.Gahakārakaṃ gavesanto, dukkhā jāti punappunaṃ.Gahakāraka diṭṭhosi, puna gehaṃ na kāhasi.Sabbā te phāsukā bhaggā, gahakūṭaṃ visaṅkhitaṃ.Visaṅkhāragataṃ cittaṃ, taṇhānaṃ khayam ajjhagā.",
